{"id":"d9ab216026d4c49a","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-k-lob-rule.md","title":"Admissibility of the Lob Rule in K","display":"thm-k-lob-rule — Admissibility of the Lob Rule in K","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-k-lob-rule","aliases":["89-thm-k-lob-rule"],"display":"thm-k-lob-rule — Admissibility of the Lob Rule in K","depends_on":["[[89-lem-k-acyclic-countermodel]]","[[89-df-modal-logic-k]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-k-lob-rule"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-k-lob-rule</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-k-lob-rule — Admissibility of the Lob Rule in K"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f6a587dbcd36439d\" href=\"?note=f6a587dbcd36439d\" title=\"89-lem-k-acyclic-countermodel\">89-lem-k-acyclic-countermodel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"550226a6aaff441c\" href=\"?note=550226a6aaff441c\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-k\">89-df-modal-logic-k</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm K\">\\(\\mathrm K\\)</span> 为最小正规模态定理集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}k\\text{-}lob\\text{-}rule}\\vdash\n(\\Box A\\to A)\\in\\mathrm K\\Longrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm K.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}k\\text{-}lob\\text{-}rule}\\vdash\n(\\Box A\\to A)\\in\\mathrm K\\Longrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm K.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 10 章 p.147。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>逆否证明。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\notin\\mathrm K\">\\(A\\notin\\mathrm K\\)</span>，取有限无环反模型。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为假的世界集非空；其中存在一个没有“使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为假”的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 后继的世界，否则有限步重复给出环。该世界的所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 后继满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\">\\(\\Box A\\)</span> 真而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 假；从而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\\to A\">\\(\\Box A\\to A\\)</span> 不是 K 定理。</p>\n<p>这是元层可采纳规则，不断言 Löb 公理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box(\\Box A\\to A)\\to\\Box A\">\\(\\Box(\\Box A\\to A)\\to\\Box A\\)</span> 在 K 内可证。K 的框架可靠性可直接由重言式、K 模式及两条规则的保真性归纳证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-lem-k-acyclic-countermodel","status":"resolved","id":"f6a587dbcd36439d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-k-acyclic-countermodel]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-logic-k","status":"resolved","id":"550226a6aaff441c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-logic-k]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}k\\text{-}lob\\text{-}rule}\\vdash\n(\\Box A\\to A)\\in\\mathrm K\\Longrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm K.","display":true},{"tex":"A\\notin\\mathrm K","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box A\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box(\\Box A\\to A)\\to\\Box A","display":false}],"bytes":1254,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-155","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"反模型：[[89-ex-gl-tableau-countermodel]]。命题优先条件及旧任意次序的反例：[[89-ex-gl-tableau-order]]。关系树与高度界：[[89-thm-gl-tree-completeness]]。K 的补充：[[89-lem-k-acyclic-countermodel]] → [[89-thm-k-lob-rule]]。"}],"outgoing":["f6a587dbcd36439d","550226a6aaff441c"]}